msgid ""
"Returns the recorded audio as an :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` resource. The "
"returned audio stream can be played back, saved to disk, or used like any other audio resource. "
"This method should be called after setting "
":ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>` to ``false`` to "
"stop the recording."
msgstr ""
"返回当前缓存内容生成的 WAV 音频流。 （参见   :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>`  ） （参见   "
":ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>`  ）"

